# novadeck: enable seatd on release as the session's seat broker (SteamOS layer B). The gamescope
# launcher (run as the deck user by the SDDM autologin session) opens the DRM seat via this
# persistent root seatd.service (ExecStart=seatd -g seat); deck is in the `seat` group. armada runs
# seatd alongside SDDM too. /etc/machine-id is empty on a fresh image so systemd runs preset-all on
# first boot, where the stock 99-default.preset is "disable *"; this higher-priority preset (60 < 99)
# keeps seatd enabled. A build-time multi-user.target.wants symlink ships alongside as a fallback
# (cf. inputplumber's 60-novadeck).
enable seatd.service
